WEBVTT

00:06.040 --> 00:07.250
It's begun!

00:07.500 --> 00:08.500
But...

00:09.380 --> 00:10.500
This is fine.

00:10.830 --> 00:13.960
We have the advantage as long as
we're fighting inside this base.

00:14.670 --> 00:16.960
So come and get us, dragons!

00:18.920 --> 00:20.880
Please help us.

00:21.380 --> 00:24.330
We escaped the dragons.

00:24.540 --> 00:25.540
What?

00:28.920 --> 00:31.920
They brought us here as food
for the dragons.

00:32.380 --> 00:34.460
Please hide us.

00:34.460 --> 00:35.830
Please don't shoot!

00:39.750 --> 00:41.830
Olto Zora, the Mad Maestro.

00:41.830 --> 00:44.170
His power is Chemical Synthesis.

00:44.630 --> 00:47.000
He can make potent drugs
that instantly kill living beings

00:47.000 --> 00:48.920
and drugs that hypnotize his targets.

00:49.460 --> 00:51.000
Don't lower your guns!

00:51.000 --> 00:52.250
They're a threat!

01:05.790 --> 01:06.750
This is bad.

01:06.750 --> 01:08.290
Everyone's rattled.

01:08.580 --> 01:09.790
We must kill them!

01:10.000 --> 01:11.460
I'll take the lead!

01:13.330 --> 01:16.250
I don't wanna die!

01:25.040 --> 01:26.830
Your... Highness.

01:26.830 --> 01:27.960
Do not waver!

01:28.290 --> 01:31.710
You can only save the lives of
the civilians you're shielding

01:31.710 --> 01:34.210
and the lives of the soldiers
fighting beside you!

01:34.500 --> 01:37.040
Everything else is your enemy!

01:37.420 --> 01:38.420
Kill them!

01:38.420 --> 01:39.750
Kill them all!

01:39.750 --> 01:43.330
If you cannot, then I'll do it myself!

01:50.710 --> 01:52.920
I'm leaving command of this base to you, Ike!

01:55.080 --> 01:56.000
Yes, ma'am.

01:56.290 --> 01:57.380
Gunners!

01:57.670 --> 01:58.750
Chris!

01:58.750 --> 01:59.920
Nazarena!

01:59.920 --> 02:01.250
Come with me!

02:01.710 --> 02:04.000
We're going to attack the forest!

02:04.420 --> 02:06.000
Wow, incredible!

02:06.000 --> 02:10.250
The Silverware Princess is even
more exceptional than they say!

02:10.250 --> 02:15.710
But this is all exactly as I predicted.

02:16.710 --> 02:18.080
Come here.

02:18.080 --> 02:20.170
I'll teach you a thing or two
on the battlefield.

02:20.170 --> 02:22.960
But this lesson will cost your life.

03:54.380 --> 03:59.710
Episode 13: Hero of the Battle

03:56.290 --> 03:58.000
Mature bloodline members.

03:58.210 --> 04:00.210
People call them "superior dragons."

04:00.380 --> 04:06.380
Their talent generally can be measured by
how long their Maturation takes.

04:06.920 --> 04:09.920
It's thought that the less time it takes,
the more powerful they are.

04:09.920 --> 04:12.000
It takes ten to fifteen years on average.

04:12.000 --> 04:13.920
The fastest ones are done within a year.

04:14.250 --> 04:16.960
Taratectra took twenty years.

04:19.170 --> 04:20.500
In other words...

04:24.750 --> 04:30.330
I have no talent as
a member of the bloodline.

04:33.040 --> 04:37.380
What I have is power I honed
during my time as a human.

04:40.130 --> 04:41.540
And nothing more!

04:51.670 --> 04:52.380
Dang!

04:52.830 --> 04:55.250
Blood is flame!

05:02.500 --> 05:03.630
He's tough.

05:04.040 --> 05:07.790
I put all my power into that blow,
but I couldn't cut off his arm.

05:08.170 --> 05:09.460
Taratectra.

05:09.460 --> 05:10.790
Olto Zora.

05:10.790 --> 05:12.540
An army of ten thousand dragons.

05:13.040 --> 05:14.790
They're nothing!

05:14.790 --> 05:17.210
They will all perish beneath our blades!

05:20.920 --> 05:25.040
I would like to express my sincere
admiration of your strength.

05:25.460 --> 05:26.500
Don't want it.

05:27.750 --> 05:29.500
Either that blow just now

05:29.500 --> 05:33.500
or that first blow should've done you in.

05:34.920 --> 05:36.380
Your life needs to end.

05:38.880 --> 05:41.580
The next one should do the trick.

05:42.630 --> 05:43.880
I am ready.

05:44.170 --> 05:46.790
Behold the pinnacle of my power!

05:47.920 --> 05:51.960
No matter what the dragon does,
I'll crush its magic and win!

05:52.500 --> 05:55.040
I need a massive amount of
silverine to do that.

05:55.630 --> 05:59.710
But now, my Silverine Battle Arts
are dormant within my body.

06:00.380 --> 06:01.460
So...

06:02.880 --> 06:06.210
I'll create another source of power
outside of my body!

06:06.880 --> 06:08.790
Man and blade are one.

06:08.790 --> 06:11.170
The ultimate output possible in one slash!

06:12.750 --> 06:14.250
I understand.

06:14.250 --> 06:18.130
Your techniques embody
the limits of strength.

06:18.130 --> 06:21.130
It serves as a clear, simple answer.

06:21.670 --> 06:25.460
Which of our answers
will prove to be superior?

06:26.080 --> 06:27.920
Dragon Slaying Strike...

06:29.040 --> 06:30.290
Hunting Flash!

06:30.500 --> 06:32.880
Threefold Arm...

06:33.420 --> 06:36.000
Seismic Cannon!

06:46.080 --> 06:50.920
I delegate to other people so I can
exercise my powers to the fullest.

06:51.290 --> 06:56.040
I only control the propulsion
and let each individual handle the rest.

06:57.130 --> 07:00.830
This is currently the most
optimal use of my powers.

07:00.830 --> 07:04.630
Hence, the Aerial Mobile
Gunner Squad was formed.

07:06.540 --> 07:08.210
Oh my, amazing!

07:08.210 --> 07:10.960
So they really do have an aerial unit.

07:11.460 --> 07:13.330
Dragon body heat detected.

07:13.580 --> 07:17.330
There's a horde of about a thousand dragons
surrounding the base.

07:17.790 --> 07:21.210
There are about ten thousand in total,
which matches prior intel.

07:21.460 --> 07:23.710
There were consecutive explosions
south of the base.

07:23.710 --> 07:26.380
That's probably Ragna and
the Explosive Dragon's battle.

07:26.790 --> 07:29.290
Unable to detect the Mad Maestro Dragon.

07:29.710 --> 07:34.540
Even on dark nights, the twins can
see clearly for miles and miles.

07:34.830 --> 07:37.580
There are two hordes five hundred meters
from the north entrance.

07:37.580 --> 07:39.080
The same for the south entrance.

07:39.380 --> 07:42.420
In each horde, there are about two hundred
to three hundred humans.

07:42.710 --> 07:46.170
The total number of humans detected
in the area is over fifteen hundred.

07:46.170 --> 07:52.250
Their voices can reach their desired
recipient's ears as if they were arrows.

07:53.250 --> 07:55.920
Two more hordes are approaching
the east entrance.

07:55.920 --> 07:57.080
Four thousand in total!

07:57.080 --> 07:59.580
It's possible they're expecting our attack.

08:00.040 --> 08:01.380
It's no matter.

08:01.540 --> 08:03.630
On the contrary, it's exactly what I want!

08:05.380 --> 08:06.750
Oh?

08:06.960 --> 08:12.420
In just a short while, they annihilated
the first wave of three hundred humans.

08:13.210 --> 08:17.670
Although they were ordinary people,
my drugs removed the fetters of their minds.

08:17.670 --> 08:20.420
Yet they took out my mob in a flash.

08:20.670 --> 08:24.210
And what's more,
the corps sustained no losses.

08:30.460 --> 08:33.210
I know you all want this fight.

08:33.210 --> 08:35.880
And they're going to give us one.

08:36.580 --> 08:38.580
They shall give us an outlet...

08:39.920 --> 08:41.880
For our rage!

08:41.880 --> 08:43.830
Oh my!

08:43.830 --> 08:45.580
It's been so long since I went to war!

08:45.580 --> 08:48.080
What a delight!

08:48.830 --> 08:52.330
But this still falls in line
with my predictions.

08:52.330 --> 08:54.460
If I'm worried, it's for...

09:01.960 --> 09:03.420
Tara, darling?

09:03.630 --> 09:05.580
Answer me, Tara, dearest!

09:05.580 --> 09:07.080
Are you okay?

09:09.080 --> 09:12.080
All is well.

09:14.250 --> 09:15.670
I am...

09:19.130 --> 09:20.830
victorious.

09:20.920 --> 09:22.790
Hey! C'mon!

09:24.250 --> 09:28.170
Phew! Don't scare me like that!

09:28.420 --> 09:34.580
But it's astounding there's a human
who is able to push you that hard.

09:34.580 --> 09:37.130
Are you able to continue fighting?

09:37.130 --> 09:38.250
Yes.

09:39.380 --> 09:42.420
But since I used my Seismic Cannon,

09:42.420 --> 09:45.420
I'll be unable to use magic for a while.

09:45.420 --> 09:47.630
Just to confirm,

09:47.630 --> 09:52.330
silverine wasn't emitting
from his body, was it?

09:52.630 --> 09:56.830
If he had a trump card like that,
he would have used it.

09:56.830 --> 09:58.130
True...

09:58.130 --> 10:02.420
So he wasn't the Reaper
who tried to kill Tia.

10:02.630 --> 10:04.830
Don't let your guard down, comrade.

10:04.830 --> 10:05.130
C'mon! Wake up, shtupid human!

10:05.130 --> 10:07.630
C'mon! Wake up, shtupid human!
That man may have not been the Reaper,

10:07.630 --> 10:11.920
but that doesn't mean he isn't
present on the battlefield.

10:11.920 --> 10:13.290
Let my guard down?

10:13.540 --> 10:15.920
Have you forgotten who you're talking to?

10:15.920 --> 10:19.750
Why don't you make sure to finish him off?

10:20.040 --> 10:21.790
All is well.

10:22.460 --> 10:24.960
I'll take care of it now.

10:24.960 --> 10:27.920
Yikesh! Wake up now, shtupid human!

10:44.420 --> 10:45.960
He's still alive.

10:45.960 --> 10:48.040
No way! Seriously?

10:50.000 --> 10:53.670
I switched my body's cognition from
my human part to my sword part right away.

10:53.670 --> 10:57.500
If I hadn't, that attack would've
taken me down!

10:59.210 --> 11:01.420
The battle's...

11:01.420 --> 11:02.790
still on!

11:04.000 --> 11:05.290
No.

11:05.290 --> 11:08.460
Our battle is already over.

11:18.290 --> 11:20.040
Inferior dragons?

11:20.040 --> 11:25.170
You think a horde like that can kill me?

11:26.330 --> 11:28.920
You're not the top priority now.

11:28.920 --> 11:31.960
You're not a threat we need to
bother with taking out.

11:36.420 --> 11:39.830
With enough numbers, you'll be
overpowered and killed eventually.

11:40.630 --> 11:44.750
You've fallen into an ordinary
class of strength.

11:44.750 --> 11:45.710
Wait!

11:46.250 --> 11:47.830
We're not done yet!

11:48.380 --> 11:52.630
Weren't we going to speak through
our fighting strength?

11:52.830 --> 11:56.380
We've spoken enough for me to understand.

11:56.380 --> 11:59.670
You're stronger than me.

12:00.080 --> 12:01.630
Or you would have been,

12:01.630 --> 12:06.710
if your sword had been able to
withstand your technique's power.

12:09.540 --> 12:12.460
Victory was within your reach.

12:12.460 --> 12:16.040
Farewell, mighty nameless man.

12:16.460 --> 12:18.830
Comrade, what are your instructions?

12:18.830 --> 12:21.830
Please go to point I-29.

12:21.830 --> 12:25.080
The Silverware Princess and
her pals left their hole.

12:25.080 --> 12:28.170
Tara, dear, I want you to give them
a taste of your cannon.

12:28.170 --> 12:29.710
Understood.

12:30.040 --> 12:32.080
And don't call me Tara.

12:32.880 --> 12:35.250
You can't run!

12:35.960 --> 12:37.630
Out of my way!

12:39.000 --> 12:41.830
Out of my way!

12:52.420 --> 12:55.040
Burn!

12:58.420 --> 13:00.040
Snap out of it!

13:00.040 --> 13:03.960
Why the hell are you on your knees
getting your ass handed to you?

13:11.630 --> 13:14.080
Th-th-the short dude?

13:14.080 --> 13:15.580
I'm Shin Cutlass!

13:15.580 --> 13:16.830
I'm totally gonna murder you!

13:18.130 --> 13:20.210
Master Shin, that's enough.

13:20.500 --> 13:22.540
We are amongst the enemy.

13:22.540 --> 13:24.290
You took your sweet time, old man!

13:24.290 --> 13:25.880
Why are you here?

13:25.880 --> 13:26.830
Defending the base-

13:26.830 --> 13:28.420
We've given up on that!

13:28.630 --> 13:29.630
Why?

13:34.710 --> 13:36.830
We have not given up!

13:36.830 --> 13:39.250
Of the base's four currently
accessible entrances,

13:39.250 --> 13:41.380
the entrances at the east gate,
the old cistern,

13:41.380 --> 13:43.330
and the cliffs were blown up
and are blocked.

13:43.330 --> 13:46.040
The enemy's only path of attack
is through the north entrance

13:46.040 --> 13:47.000
where Sir Isaac's squad is posted!

13:47.000 --> 13:48.290
Keep moving!
where Sir Isaac's squad is posted!

13:48.290 --> 13:48.830
Keep moving!

13:49.170 --> 13:53.040
Her Highness is attacking with
two hundred soldiers!

13:53.290 --> 13:55.500
The commander said you were in a bind.

13:55.500 --> 13:59.080
Me and gramps are the fastest,
so we came to help!

13:59.080 --> 14:00.420
I don't need you! Leave!

14:00.420 --> 14:01.330
What?

14:03.000 --> 14:06.040
You didn't just tell me to scram, did ya?

14:06.040 --> 14:07.460
Go back right now!

14:07.460 --> 14:09.210
I can handle this by myself!

14:09.210 --> 14:12.130
Is your half-dead ass that stupid?

14:12.130 --> 14:14.420
These pushovers won't kill me!

14:16.000 --> 14:18.830
Someone else always dies.
It's never me.

14:19.250 --> 14:21.880
I've got this, so just let me handle every-

14:23.920 --> 14:26.500
What the hell are you thinking, idiot!

14:31.750 --> 14:33.790
You think you can handle this
on your own in that sorry state?

14:33.790 --> 14:35.290
Are you screwing with me?

14:35.290 --> 14:36.880
I'm not joking arou-

14:36.880 --> 14:37.880
Huh?

14:37.880 --> 14:39.920
I'm awful at telling jokes!

14:39.920 --> 14:41.500
How would I know that?

14:41.960 --> 14:46.130
We need to kill dragons and take in
their magic powers to escape!

14:46.130 --> 14:47.210
Got it?

14:47.210 --> 14:49.290
I get that! That's why I should do it alone!

14:49.290 --> 14:53.830
Then what exactly should
the rest of us do while you're fighting?

14:53.830 --> 14:56.580
Hide inside the base and
save our own asses?

14:56.580 --> 14:57.540
Yes!

15:00.290 --> 15:01.580
All right then.

15:02.460 --> 15:06.420
These past two days, I've challenged you
to sixty-nine fights and lost each time.

15:06.920 --> 15:08.880
Let's have our seventieth fight.

15:09.290 --> 15:11.040
Are you joking?

15:11.040 --> 15:12.630
Fighting here and now isn't...

15:15.540 --> 15:17.880
Now, we're taking and relocating
the civilians in this base

15:17.880 --> 15:19.750
outside this country.

15:18.880 --> 15:22.830
March 4th - 4 days before Ragna's arrival

15:19.750 --> 15:22.830
We need to avoid confrontations with
superior dragons as much as possible.

15:23.000 --> 15:24.630
I don't wanna do that.

15:24.960 --> 15:27.250
If you want to run without
putting up a fight, fine.

15:27.250 --> 15:29.630
But I'm gonna kill loads and loads
of dragons before I die.

15:29.630 --> 15:32.460
I'm gonna give them a serious
run for their money.

15:33.000 --> 15:36.380
I followed you because I thought
it would make me stronger.

15:36.380 --> 15:41.250
If you wanna run away because
you're afraid of dying, then I'm done.

15:41.790 --> 15:46.170
Oh, so how many dragons will you kill, Shin?

15:46.170 --> 15:47.960
A hundred? Two hundred?

15:47.960 --> 15:49.170
I dunno.

15:49.170 --> 15:51.170
Just as many as I can.

15:51.170 --> 15:54.710
Can you take down a superior dragon?

15:56.040 --> 15:59.670
No matter how many small fry you take out,
it won't make a difference.

16:00.540 --> 16:02.960
I want to kill superior dragons!

16:03.250 --> 16:05.710
If they strike me once,
I will strike back twice

16:05.710 --> 16:07.880
and kick them for good measure!

16:07.880 --> 16:13.420
I want to kill them all
and have a barbecue!

16:14.380 --> 16:15.380
Barbe-?

16:15.750 --> 16:17.000
Got you!

16:17.920 --> 16:19.580
Why'd ya punch-

16:19.580 --> 16:22.080
Because you've got a big mouth
for a little guy.

16:22.080 --> 16:23.670
Shut up, stupid princess!

16:23.670 --> 16:25.580
I'm just now starting my growth spurt!

16:25.580 --> 16:28.330
If you survive this,
you can prove that to me!

16:30.000 --> 16:31.580
Everyone one, listen up!

16:31.920 --> 16:33.920
After we escape this country,

16:33.920 --> 16:37.040
I plan on staying under
the protection of the Solarians!

16:37.920 --> 16:42.040
I'm certain they will work me
like a dog for a while!

16:42.830 --> 16:45.830
However, I have no intention
of being used or cowed!

16:46.040 --> 16:51.040
I will use and soak up their power
and crush the Blood of the Wing!

16:51.540 --> 16:54.540
Who will fight alongside me
when the time comes?

16:55.000 --> 16:57.040
Solarian priests?

16:58.000 --> 17:03.080
You are my soldiers, who I handpicked
and deemed worthy of my weapons.

17:03.080 --> 17:05.500
You will grow even stronger as time passes.

17:05.500 --> 17:08.210
I want to witness that!

17:08.830 --> 17:10.920
So come with me.

17:12.670 --> 17:14.750
In the half day that followed...

17:14.750 --> 17:17.380
we each thought about it
and came to our own decisions.

17:18.630 --> 17:20.960
I have family in Donapierru.

17:18.630 --> 17:20.960
Swordmaster

17:18.630 --> 17:20.960
Yugo Robles

17:21.130 --> 17:21.830
Huh?

17:21.830 --> 17:26.580
They were the very first city
attacked by the dragons.

17:26.580 --> 17:30.000
It might be too late now, but still...

17:31.960 --> 17:33.580
I've gotta go there.

17:34.210 --> 17:37.330
I want you to take over as swordmaster, Shin.

17:37.330 --> 17:38.170
What?

17:38.170 --> 17:40.710
I don't get a say in who takes over.

17:40.710 --> 17:43.540
But I know the commander will agree.

17:43.540 --> 17:46.710
Wait! I didn't say anything about stayi-

17:46.710 --> 17:48.750
Your skills are nothing to sniff at,

17:48.750 --> 17:52.580
and the most talented person
in this corps is you.

17:55.170 --> 17:56.880
You wanna get strong, don't ya?

17:56.880 --> 17:58.580
Then you gotta survive.

18:00.330 --> 18:03.040
Of the 470 members of the corps,

18:03.040 --> 18:05.880
120 decided to stay in the country.

18:07.130 --> 18:09.040
Are they still alive?

18:09.670 --> 18:11.500
Did they manage to protect anything?

18:11.960 --> 18:13.460
I don't know.

18:13.460 --> 18:15.880
I have no way to know.
And knowing would be pointless.

18:16.580 --> 18:17.830
I chose...

18:18.710 --> 18:20.710
to flee!

18:22.000 --> 18:24.540
Seventy battles, sixty-nine losses,

18:24.540 --> 18:26.500
and finally, one win!

18:27.130 --> 18:28.330
Was I careless?

18:28.330 --> 18:30.000
No, that's not it.

18:30.000 --> 18:31.880
He's grown...?

18:32.170 --> 18:34.750
There's one thing you need to get straight.

18:35.380 --> 18:37.580
This is our battle!

18:37.880 --> 18:41.130
The battle between those of us
who chose to flee and survive

18:41.130 --> 18:44.290
and the dragons who are out to kill us!

18:44.670 --> 18:46.130
But you?

18:46.130 --> 18:47.080
Listen up.

18:47.080 --> 18:49.080
No matter how strong you are,

18:49.080 --> 18:51.880
or how fantastic your reason to fight is,

18:52.290 --> 18:54.210
you can't just show up late

18:54.210 --> 18:56.500
and act like you're the hero!

19:00.750 --> 19:03.710
Sorry for the hold up, gramps.
You still alive and kicking?

19:03.710 --> 19:05.460
No need to worry.

19:06.000 --> 19:08.380
I've already cleaned up here.

19:08.670 --> 19:11.790
But it seems that more are coming now.

19:12.710 --> 19:15.130
I did a lot of hemming and hawing...

19:15.130 --> 19:19.670
But when I stood on the battlefield,
my answer became apparent.

19:20.290 --> 19:22.580
I shall assist in this battle.

19:22.580 --> 19:25.960
These old bones still want to get stronger!

19:26.290 --> 19:27.790
Hey, you trash maggot!

19:28.500 --> 19:30.500
I'm beyond dishappointed in you!

19:30.500 --> 19:32.880
I'm on thish pipshqueak'sh shide now!

19:32.880 --> 19:34.210
Who you calling a pipsqueak?

19:34.750 --> 19:38.000
And aren't you the toy the twins
were prattling on about?

19:38.000 --> 19:39.460
What nonshenshe ish that!

19:39.460 --> 19:41.580
I'm Evil Shlime!

19:41.580 --> 19:43.880
The Erupshion Dragon eshcaped!

19:43.880 --> 19:46.000
We gotta purshue him!
Sho put me on your head!

19:46.000 --> 19:47.330
Do you know where it is?

19:47.330 --> 19:49.000
Of courshe!

19:49.000 --> 19:50.000
Master Shin.

19:50.000 --> 19:52.250
Sup, gramps? You gonna try to stop me?

19:52.540 --> 19:54.380
By all means, let's go.

19:55.040 --> 19:56.420
That's the spirit!

19:58.500 --> 20:01.170
Let's hunt down the Fifth Seat
and give him hell.

20:01.170 --> 20:03.210
Nothing can bring us down now! Let's go!

20:03.210 --> 20:04.830
Let'sh give him hell!

20:07.960 --> 20:09.830
Princess-Style Barrier Arts!

20:10.380 --> 20:11.460
Cage!

20:12.880 --> 20:16.790
Did you think drawing me into the woods
would give you the advantage, Olto Zora?

20:16.790 --> 20:21.250
In that case, I'll simply transform
this forest into my territory!

20:21.580 --> 20:23.460
The dragon horde on the ground retreated.

20:23.460 --> 20:26.960
No aerial gunners were lost.

20:26.960 --> 20:28.960
Our injuries were minimal.

20:28.960 --> 20:32.210
We could take another
ten battles like that.

20:32.540 --> 20:36.750
We crushed our enemies during
the first ground and aerial clashes.

20:37.330 --> 20:39.750
Yes, yes! We did it, we did it!

20:39.750 --> 20:42.000
All that magic is just pouring in!

20:42.000 --> 20:45.250
By introducing a vertical dimension
to normally level magic circles,

20:45.250 --> 20:49.000
we've heightened the capabilities of
magic circles to a whole new level!

20:49.000 --> 20:52.670
We've ushered in a new era
for the art of magic circles!

20:52.670 --> 20:55.790
Lavish me with praise, Your Highness!

20:56.040 --> 20:58.210
Our biggest advantage is that
we don't need to win.

20:58.210 --> 21:00.040
We only need to kill dragons and survive

21:00.040 --> 21:03.000
until we've accumulated enough magic
to teleport all of us.

21:03.000 --> 21:04.000
But...

21:04.630 --> 21:08.920
She seems impulsive, but she's
actually a level-headed realist.

21:08.920 --> 21:12.290
She's able to instantly assess
what she can and cannot do.

21:12.290 --> 21:16.670
This allows her to operate at 150%
of her expected performance.

21:16.670 --> 21:19.960
Based on my impression of
the Silverware Princess

21:19.960 --> 21:22.080
I get from looking into her history,

21:22.080 --> 21:24.960
there's no way she'd saddle herself with

21:24.960 --> 21:28.130
a burden like these civilians
in a hopeless siege.

21:28.130 --> 21:30.750
She must be planning something.

21:30.750 --> 21:32.710
And her plan is...

21:32.710 --> 21:34.000
This!

21:34.790 --> 21:37.000
A magic absorption circle.

21:37.580 --> 21:40.580
They're killing dragons and
stealing magic from their bodies.

21:40.580 --> 21:43.250
And that magic will be used for...

21:43.250 --> 21:45.380
Teleportation magic.

21:47.040 --> 21:50.040
During my time as a Solarian,

21:50.040 --> 21:55.670
they were researching possibly stealing
dragons' magic and using it in battle.

21:55.670 --> 22:00.290
And now I'm witnessing that research
being successfully implemented...

22:00.710 --> 22:03.330
Although, I'm on the dragons' side now.

22:04.960 --> 22:07.790
I've got your little plan all figured out!
